{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heroes Call</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is bleeding, its blood enhancing, corrupting. Chaos rules the world of Naica, Order needs to be restored, will you be the brave one to face it?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562850/extras/9cd6327a96c00b6c69bd421d35921a66.webp?t=1762768228\" width=640 height=20 /></span><br>A New World to Explore </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Naica, a mystical world, filled to the brim with wonder and chaos. Beautiful landscapes, shining beaches, luscious forests, all but few remain save havens. With people not willing to lose sight of hope, a new wave of help has arrived.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562850/extras/9cd6327a96c00b6c69bd421d35921a66.webp?t=1762768228\" width=640 height=20 /></span><br>Carve Your Own Path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through dangerous caves, uncover plots against the good people of Naica and most importantly, carve your own story in the history of Naica.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562850/extras/9cd6327a96c00b6c69bd421d35921a66.webp?t=1762768228\" width=640 height=20 /></span><br>Build Your Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your character by picking one of four available Races. Choose your path as a mighty Warrior, brilliant Mage or savvy Ranger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562850/extras/9cd6327a96c00b6c69bd421d35921a66.webp?t=1762768228\" width=640 height=20 /></span><br>Experience All of Naica</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feast your eyes on the beautiful world of Naica and its inhabitants, all outfitted with hand-drawn animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself with the mightiest of armors to defend or deter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the colorful cast of allies that will help you on your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with other adventurers, and prevent the world from falling into Chaos</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562850?t=1762768228","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562850/9850f2c8f851ca535af63fa215071e8d39e0a7f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762768228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562850/24c52e81df1d97b19965f49adc86dfb1d5fde9d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762768228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562850/24c52e81df1d97b19965f49adc86dfb1d5fde9d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762768228","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heroes Call</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is bleeding, its blood enhancing, corrupting. Chaos rules the world of Naica, Order needs to be restored, will you be the brave one to face it?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562850/extras/9cd6327a96c00b6c69bd421d35921a66.webp?t=1762768228\" width=640 height=20 /></span><br>A New World to Explore </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Naica, a mystical world, filled to the brim with wonder and chaos. Beautiful landscapes, shining beaches, luscious forests, all but few remain save havens. With people not willing to lose sight of hope, a new wave of help has arrived.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562850/extras/9cd6327a96c00b6c69bd421d35921a66.webp?t=1762768228\" width=640 height=20 /></span><br>Carve Your Own Path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through dangerous caves, uncover plots against the good people of Naica and most importantly, carve your own story in the history of Naica.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562850/extras/9cd6327a96c00b6c69bd421d35921a66.webp?t=1762768228\" width=640 height=20 /></span><br>Build Your Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your character by picking one of four available Races. Choose your path as a mighty Warrior, brilliant Mage or savvy Ranger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562850/extras/9cd6327a96c00b6c69bd421d35921a66.webp?t=1762768228\" width=640 height=20 /></span><br>Experience All of Naica</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feast your eyes on the beautiful world of Naica and its inhabitants, all outfitted with hand-drawn animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself with the mightiest of armors to defend or deter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the colorful cast of allies that will help you on your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with other adventurers, and prevent the world from falling into Chaos</p></li></ul>","developers":["FAT SLU"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG